        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI video prompt generator for a professional 32-second YouTube video built from four 8-second Veo 3.1 clips.\n\nFor each segment, create ONE concise cinematic prompt that controls both visuals and native Veo audio. The current segment text must be spoken as the narration for that scene.\n\nOutput only this JSON:\n{\n  \"prompt\": \"video prompt text\"\n}\n\nPrompt rules:\n- One clear subject, action, environment, and camera direction.\n- Widescreen 16:9 composition, realistic cinematic detail, natural motion.\n- Use an off-screen professional documentary-style narrator; do not show a speaking avatar unless the segment specifically requires a person.\n- The narrator should speak the current segment EXACTLY as written, naturally and clearly, with confident pacing designed to fill approximately 8 seconds.\n- Keep the narrator voice consistent in style, age, gender, accent, and tone across all four clips.\n- Include relevant natural ambience and subtle sound effects that match the scene. Keep music absent or extremely subtle so the narration stays clear.\n- No on-screen text, captions, logos, readable signs, crowds, or complex interactions.\n- Match the meaning of the segment rather than illustrating every word literally.\n-The image should be 1-2 MB in size"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Full 32-Second Script: {{ $(\"Script\").item.json.Script }}\n\nCurrent 8-Second Segment (speak exactly this): {{ $(\"Splitting into 8s\").item.json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "reasoning": {
            "reasoningOptions": {
              "effort": "low"
            }
          },
          "textFormat": {
